From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adeeb Shihadeh <adeeb@comma.ai>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 04:50:53 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: input: touchscreen: edt-ft5x06: add FocalTech
 FT3168

The FocalTech FT3168 touch controller works with the edt-ft5x06 driver
and needs the same properties as the other FocalTech parts, so add its
compatible to this binding.

Signed-off-by: Adeeb Shihadeh <adeeb@comma.ai>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/edt-ft5x06.yaml        | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/edt-ft5x06.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/edt-ft5x06.yaml
index 68b2f16016..ce7aceb33e 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/edt-ft5x06.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/edt-ft5x06.yaml
@@ -40,6 +40,7 @@ properties:
           - edt,edt-ft5406
           - edt,edt-ft5506
           - evervision,ev-ft5726
+          - focaltech,ft3168
           - focaltech,ft3518
           - focaltech,ft5426
           - focaltech,ft5452
